    "title": "Job Opening Category Manager at Rapido Consulting Pvt Ltd",
    "description": "Rapido Consulting Pvt Ltd, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Category Manager for our Coimbatore operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout Rapido Consulting Pvt Ltd:\nRapido Consulting Pvt Ltd is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Track key performance indicators including GMV, conversion rate, and ROI\n• Manage email marketing campaigns and push notifications\n• Create engaging content for product pages and social media\n• Manage customer reviews, ratings, and return/refund processes\n• Optimize product pages for search visibility and conversion\n• Conduct competitor analysis and market benchmarking\n• Collaborate with logistics partners to ensure timely delivery\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Google Analytics\n• Proficiency in Affiliate Marketing\n• Proficiency in Facebook Ads\n• Proficiency in Customer Segmentation\n• Proficiency in Email Marketing\n• Proficiency in WooCommerce\n• Proficiency in Product Management\n• Proficiency in Shopify\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Referral bonus program\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Rapido Consulting Pvt Ltd!",
